    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:heat_death_ember",
      "text": "The last warmth of a universe going cold: a little above the temperature of its own horizon, and falling.$(br2)Made in $(item)Entropy Horizon$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:de_sitter_horizon_shard",
      "text": "A piece of the cosmic horizon of an empty, accelerating universe. It glows at 10^-30 K and holds 10^122 bits.$(br2)Made in $(item)Entropy Horizon$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:heat_death_remnant",
      "text": "All that is left of a universe at maximum entropy. Cold, even and perfectly still.$(br2)Made in $(item)Universe Forge$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
      "item": "theoreticalsciences:boltzmann_fluctuation",
      "text": "Wait long enough in a universe at equilibrium and anything happens by chance. This is the anything.$(br2)Made in $(item)Entropy Horizon$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "$(thing)Where these go$():$(li)$(item)Heat Death Ember$(): Aeon Boundary Shard, De Sitter Horizon Shard, Heat Death Remnant$(li)$(item)De Sitter Horizon Shard$(): Aeon Boundary Shard, Boltzmann Fluctuation, Cosmological Constant, Heat Death Remnant$(li)$(item)Heat Death Remnant$(): Absolute Singularity, Boltzmann Brain, Inflaton Field, Universe Seed$(li)$(item)Boltzmann Fluctuation$(): Boltzmann Brain"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:spotlight",
